  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n  <main id=\"main\">\n   <section class=\"hero\">\n    <div class=\"container hero__inner\">\n     <p class=\"hero__eyebrow\">Learn the world by playing</p>\n     <h1 class=\"hero__title\">Learn Every Flag in the World</h1>\n     <p class=\"hero__lede\">Start with the world flags quiz below — all 197 countries, playable right here. No sign-up, and everything you miss links straight to a page that explains it.</p>\n     <ul class=\"hero__stats\" role=\"list\">\n      <li class=\"hero__stat\"><strong>197</strong> <span>countries</span></li>\n      <li class=\"hero__stat\"><strong>10</strong> <span>ways to play</span></li>\n      <li class=\"hero__stat\"><strong>6</strong> <span>quiz types</span></li>\n     </ul>\n    </div>\n   </section>\n   <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"play-shell\">\n     <div class=\"quiz\" id=\"quiz\" data-quiz data-type=\"flags\" data-mode=\"default\" data-region=\"world\">\n      <div class=\"mode-picker\" data-quiz-modes role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Mode\">\n       <button type=\"button\" class=\"mode-chip\" data-mode=\"default\" aria-current=\"true\"><span>Multiple choice</span></button>\n       <button type=\"button\" class=\"mode-chip\" data-mode=\"true-false\"><span>True or false</span></button>\n       <button type=\"button\" class=\"mode-chip\" data-mode=\"multiple-flags\"><span>Pick the flag</span></button>\n       <button type=\"button\" class=\"mode-chip\" data-mode=\"odd-one-out\"><span>Odd one out</span></button>\n       <button type=\"button\" class=\"mode-chip\" data-mode=\"higher-lower\"><span>Higher or lower</span></button>\n       <button type=\"button\" class=\"mode-chip\" data-mode=\"letters\"><span>Missing letters</span></button>\n       <button type=\"button\" class=\"mode-chip\" data-mode=\"spelling\"><span>Type the answer</span></button>\n       <button type=\"button\" class=\"mode-chip\" data-mode=\"timed\"><span>Timed</span></button>\n       <button type=\"button\" class=\"mode-chip\" data-mode=\"survival\"><span>Survival</span></button>\n       <button type=\"button\" class=\"mode-chip\" data-mode=\"flashcards\"><span>Flashcards</span></button>\n      </div>\n      <div data-quiz-start>\n       <div class=\"quiz__stage\">\n        <img class=\"quiz__flag\" src=\"https://flagquizzes.com/img/flags/kh.svg\" alt=\"\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"sync\">\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"quiz__actions\"></div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <section class=\"section\" aria-labelledby=\"levels-heading\">\n     <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <div class=\"section-head__lead\">\n       <h2 id=\"levels-heading\">Pick your level</h2>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n     <p class=\"section-head__lede\">The same countries split three ways, by how often people actually get them wrong. Start easy and work up — each level keeps its own progress.</p>\n     <div class=\"ladder\">\n      <a class=\"level-card level-card--easy\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/flags/world/?difficulty=easy\" data-mastery data-type=\"flags\" data-ids=\"at,be,dk,fi,fr,de,gr,ie,it,nl,no,pl,pt,ru,es,se,ch,ua,gb,cn,in,id,il,jp,pk,sa,kr,th,tr,vn,eg,ma,za,ca,cu,jm,mx,us,ar,br,cl,co,pe,au,nz\"> <span class=\"level-card__body\"> <span class=\"level-card__name\"> Level 1 <em>Easy</em> </span> <span class=\"level-card__desc\">The flags most people already half-know.</span> </span> <span class=\"level-card__side\"> <span class=\"level-card__count\">45 countries</span> </span> </a> <a class=\"level-card level-card--medium\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/flags/world/?difficulty=medium\" data-mastery data-type=\"flags\" data-ids=\"al,by,ba,bg,hr,cy,cz,ee,hu,is,lv,lt,lu,mt,mc,ro,rs,sk,si,va,af,am,az,bh,bd,kh,ge,ir,iq,jo,kz,kw,lb,my,mn,mm,np,kp,om,ps,ph,qa,sg,lk,sy,tw,ae,ye,dz,ao,bw,cm,td,cd,ci,et,gh,ke,ly,na,ng,sn,so,ss,sd,tz,tn,ug,zw,bs,bb,cr,do,gt,ht,hn,ni,pa,tt,bo,ec,py,uy,ve,fj,pg\"> <span class=\"level-card__body\"> <span class=\"level-card__name\"> Level 2 <em>Medium</em> </span> <span class=\"level-card__desc\">Where scores usually start to slip.</span> </span> <span class=\"level-card__side\"> <span class=\"level-card__count\">86 countries</span> </span> </a> <a class=\"level-card level-card--hard\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/flags/world/?difficulty=hard\" data-mastery data-type=\"flags\" data-ids=\"ad,xk,li,md,me,mk,sm,bt,bn,kg,la,mv,tj,tl,tm,uz,bj,bf,bi,cv,cf,km,cg,dj,gq,er,sz,ga,gm,gn,gw,ls,lr,mg,mw,ml,mr,mu,mz,ne,rw,st,sc,sl,tg,zm,ag,bz,dm,sv,gd,kn,lc,vc,gy,sr,ki,mh,fm,nr,pw,ws,sb,to,tv,vu\"> <span class=\"level-card__body\"> <span class=\"level-card__name\"> Level 3 <em>Hard</em> </span> <span class=\"level-card__desc\">The ones that decide whether you really know the world.</span> </span> <span class=\"level-card__side\"> <span class=\"level-card__count\">66 countries</span> </span> </a> <a class=\"level-card level-card--all\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/flags/world/\" data-mastery data-mastery-global data-type=\"flags\" data-ids=\"al,ad,at,by,be,ba,bg,hr,cy,cz,dk,ee,fi,fr,de,gr,hu,is,ie,it,xk,lv,li,lt,lu,mt,md,mc,me,nl,mk,no,pl,pt,ro,ru,sm,rs,sk,si,es,se,ch,ua,gb,va,af,am,az,bh,bd,bt,bn,kh,cn,ge,in,id,ir,iq,il,jp,jo,kz,kw,kg,la,lb,my,mv,mn,mm,np,kp,om,pk,ps,ph,qa,sa,sg,kr,lk,sy,tw,tj,th,tl,tr,tm,ae,uz,vn,ye,dz,ao,bj,bw,bf,bi,cm,cv,cf,td,km,cd,cg,ci,dj,eg,gq,er,sz,et,ga,gm,gh,gn,gw,ke,ls,lr,ly,mg,mw,ml,mr,mu,ma,mz,na,ne,ng,rw,st,sn,sc,sl,so,za,ss,sd,tz,tg,tn,ug,zm,zw,ag,bs,bb,bz,ca,cr,cu,dm,do,sv,gd,gt,ht,hn,jm,mx,ni,pa,kn,lc,vc,tt,us,ar,bo,br,cl,co,ec,gy,py,pe,sr,uy,ve,au,fj,ki,mh,fm,nr,nz,pw,pg,ws,sb,to,tv,vu\"> <span class=\"level-card__body\"> <span class=\"level-card__name\">All levels</span> <span class=\"level-card__desc\">Every country at once, difficulties mixed.</span> </span> <span class=\"level-card__side\"> <span class=\"level-card__count\">197 countries</span> </span> </a>\n     </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" aria-labelledby=\"continents-heading\">\n     <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <div class=\"section-head__lead\">\n       <h2 id=\"continents-heading\">Continents</h2>\n      </div>\n      <a class=\"section-head__more\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/flags/\"> <span>View all</span> </a>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"card-grid\">\n      <a class=\"region-card\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/flags/europe/\" data-mastery data-type=\"flags\" data-ids=\"al,ad,at,by,be,ba,bg,hr,cy,cz,dk,ee,fi,fr,de,gr,hu,is,ie,it,xk,lv,li,lt,lu,mt,md,mc,me,nl,mk,no,pl,pt,ro,ru,sm,rs,sk,si,es,se,ch,ua,gb,va\"> <span class=\"region-card__art\"> </span> <span class=\"region-card__body\"> <span class=\"region-card__name\">Europe</span> <span class=\"region-card__meta\">46 countries</span> </span> </a> <a class=\"region-card\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/flags/asia/\" data-mastery data-type=\"flags\" data-ids=\"af,am,az,bh,bd,bt,bn,kh,cn,ge,in,id,ir,iq,il,jp,jo,kz,kw,kg,la,lb,my,mv,mn,mm,np,kp,om,pk,ps,ph,qa,sa,sg,kr,lk,sy,tw,tj,th,tl,tr,tm,ae,uz,vn,ye\"> <span class=\"region-card__art\"> </span> <span class=\"region-card__body\"> <span class=\"region-card__name\">Asia</span> <span class=\"region-card__meta\">48 countries</span> </span> </a> <a class=\"region-card\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/flags/africa/\" data-mastery data-type=\"flags\" data-ids=\"dz,ao,bj,bw,bf,bi,cm,cv,cf,td,km,cd,cg,ci,dj,eg,gq,er,sz,et,ga,gm,gh,gn,gw,ke,ls,lr,ly,mg,mw,ml,mr,mu,ma,mz,na,ne,ng,rw,st,sn,sc,sl,so,za,ss,sd,tz,tg,tn,ug,zm,zw\"> <span class=\"region-card__art\"> </span> <span class=\"region-card__body\"> <span class=\"region-card__name\">Africa</span> <span class=\"region-card__meta\">54 countries</span> </span> </a> <a class=\"region-card\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/flags/north-america/\" data-mastery data-type=\"flags\" data-ids=\"ag,bs,bb,bz,ca,cr,cu,dm,do,sv,gd,gt,ht,hn,jm,mx,ni,pa,kn,lc,vc,tt,us\"> <span class=\"region-card__art\"> </span> <span class=\"region-card__body\"> <span class=\"region-card__name\">North America</span> <span class=\"region-card__meta\">23 countries</span> </span> </a> <a class=\"region-card\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/flags/south-america/\" data-mastery data-type=\"flags\" data-ids=\"ar,bo,br,cl,co,ec,gy,py,pe,sr,uy,ve\"> <span class=\"region-card__art\"> </span> <span class=\"region-card__body\"> <span class=\"region-card__name\">South America</span> <span class=\"region-card__meta\">12 countries</span> </span> </a> <a class=\"region-card\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/flags/oceania/\" data-mastery data-type=\"flags\" data-ids=\"au,fj,ki,mh,fm,nr,nz,pw,pg,ws,sb,to,tv,vu\"> <span class=\"region-card__art\"> </span> <span class=\"region-card__body\"> <span class=\"region-card__name\">Oceania</span> <span class=\"region-card__meta\">14 countries</span> </span> </a>\n     </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" aria-labelledby=\"types-heading\">\n     <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <div class=\"section-head__lead\">\n       <h2 id=\"types-heading\">Other quiz types</h2>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"card-grid card-grid--types\">\n      <a class=\"type-card type-card--flags\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/flags/\"> <span class=\"type-card__name\">Flags</span> <span class=\"type-card__meta\">Name the country from its flag</span> </a> <a class=\"type-card type-card--capitals\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/capitals/\"> <span class=\"type-card__name\">Capitals</span> <span class=\"type-card__meta\">Match every country to its capital city</span> </a> <a class=\"type-card type-card--maps\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/maps/\"> <span class=\"type-card__name\">Maps</span> <span class=\"type-card__meta\">Click countries on a real map</span> </a> <a class=\"type-card type-card--shapes\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/shapes/\"> <span class=\"type-card__name\">Shapes</span> <span class=\"type-card__meta\">Name the country from its outline</span> </a> <a class=\"type-card type-card--currencies\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/currencies/\"> <span class=\"type-card__name\">Currencies</span> <span class=\"type-card__meta\">Name the money each country spends</span> </a> <a class=\"type-card type-card--languages\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/languages/\"> <span class=\"type-card__name\">Languages</span> <span class=\"type-card__meta\">Name the language each country speaks</span> </a>\n     </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" aria-labelledby=\"states-heading\">\n     <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <div class=\"section-head__lead\">\n       <h2 id=\"states-heading\">Beyond countries</h2>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n     <p class=\"section-head__lede\">The same games applied to the geography that is not a country — states, rivers and oceans.</p>\n     <div class=\"card-grid card-grid--types\">\n      <a class=\"type-card type-card--flags\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/flags/us-states/\"> <span class=\"type-card__name\">the US States</span> <span class=\"type-card__meta\">Flags · 51 states</span> </a> <a class=\"type-card type-card--capitals\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/capitals/us-states/\"> <span class=\"type-card__name\">the US States</span> <span class=\"type-card__meta\">Capitals · 51 states</span> </a> <a class=\"type-card type-card--maps\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/maps/us-states/\"> <span class=\"type-card__name\">the US States</span> <span class=\"type-card__meta\">Maps · 51 states</span> </a> <a class=\"type-card type-card--shapes\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/shapes/us-states/\"> <span class=\"type-card__name\">the US States</span> <span class=\"type-card__meta\">Shapes · 51 states</span> </a> <a class=\"type-card type-card--rivers\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/rivers/\"> <span class=\"type-card__name\">Rivers</span> <span class=\"type-card__meta\">52 major rivers</span> </a> <a class=\"type-card type-card--oceans\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/oceans/\"> <span class=\"type-card__name\">Oceans</span> <span class=\"type-card__meta\">All 5 oceans</span> </a>\n     </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" aria-labelledby=\"ways-heading\">\n     <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <div class=\"section-head__lead\">\n       <h2 id=\"ways-heading\">Ways to play</h2>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n     <p class=\"section-head__lede\">Ten ways to play the same countries. Switch any time — your progress follows you.</p>\n     <div class=\"ways\">\n      <a class=\"way\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/flags/world/\"> <span> <span class=\"way__name\">Multiple choice</span> <span class=\"way__desc\">Four options, one right answer</span> </span> </a> <a class=\"way\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/flags/world/?mode=true-false\"> <span> <span class=\"way__name\">True or false</span> <span class=\"way__desc\">One claim, yes or no — the quickest way to play</span> </span> </a> <a class=\"way\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/flags/world/?mode=multiple-flags\"> <span> <span class=\"way__name\">Pick the flag</span> <span class=\"way__desc\">We name the country, you pick its flag</span> </span> </a> <a class=\"way\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/flags/world/?mode=odd-one-out\"> <span> <span class=\"way__name\">Odd one out</span> <span class=\"way__desc\">Three from one region, one intruder</span> </span> </a> <a class=\"way\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/flags/world/?mode=higher-lower\"> <span> <span class=\"way__name\">Higher or lower</span> <span class=\"way__desc\">Bigger, or more people? Pick a side</span> </span> </a> <a class=\"way\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/flags/world/?mode=letters\"> <span> <span class=\"way__name\">Missing letters</span> <span class=\"way__desc\">The name with holes in it — fill the gaps</span> </span> </a> <a class=\"way\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/flags/world/?mode=spelling\"> <span> <span class=\"way__name\">Type the answer</span> <span class=\"way__desc\">Type the answer, accents optional</span> </span> </a> <a class=\"way\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/flags/world/?mode=timed\"> <span> <span class=\"way__name\">Timed</span> <span class=\"way__desc\">Sixty seconds, as many as you can</span> </span> </a> <a class=\"way\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/flags/world/?mode=survival\"> <span> <span class=\"way__name\">Survival</span> <span class=\"way__desc\">Three lives. One run. How far do you get?</span> </span> </a> <a class=\"way\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/flags/world/?mode=flashcards\"> <span> <span class=\"way__name\">Flashcards</span> <span class=\"way__desc\">Flip to learn, weakest cards first</span> </span> </a>\n     </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" aria-labelledby=\"regions-heading\">\n     <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <div class=\"section-head__lead\">\n       <h2 id=\"regions-heading\">More quizzes</h2>\n      </div>\n      <a class=\"section-head__more\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/flags/\"> <span>View all</span> </a>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"chip-set\">\n      <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/flags/middle-east/\">Middle East</a> <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/flags/caribbean/\">Caribbean</a> <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/flags/central-america/\">Central America</a> <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/flags/southeast-asia/\">Southeast Asia</a> <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/flags/east-asia/\">East Asia</a> <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/flags/south-asia/\">South Asia</a> <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/flags/west-africa/\">West Africa</a> <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/flags/east-africa/\">East Africa</a> <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/flags/north-africa/\">North Africa</a> <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/flags/central-africa/\">Central Africa</a>\n     </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" aria-labelledby=\"lists-heading\">\n     <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <div class=\"section-head__lead\">\n       <h2 id=\"lists-heading\">Lists</h2>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n     <div>\n      <a class=\"card card--outlined card--link\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/list/hardest-flags-to-guess/\"> \n       <p class=\"card__title\">Hardest flags to guess</p> \n       <p class=\"card__meta\">The flags people get wrong most often — obscure designs with close look-alikes. Ranked, with what makes each one difficult.</p> \n      </a> <a class=\"card card--outlined card--link\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/list/flags-that-look-the-same/\"> \n       <p class=\"card__title\">Flags that look the same</p> \n       <p class=\"card__meta\">Chad and Romania, Monaco and Indonesia, Ireland and Côte d'Ivoire. Every confusable flag pair, with the detail that separates them.</p> \n      </a> <a class=\"card card--outlined card--link\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/list/red-white-blue-flags/\"> \n       <p class=\"card__title\">Red, white and blue flags</p> \n       <p class=\"card__meta\">All the national flags using red, white and blue — far more than most people expect, and a common source of quiz mistakes.</p> \n      </a> <a class=\"card card--outlined card--link\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/list/newest-flags-in-the-world/\"> \n       <p class=\"card__title\">Newest flags</p> \n       <p class=\"card__meta\">The most recently adopted national flags, from the newest design backwards, with the year each one came into use.</p> \n      </a> <a class=\"card card--outlined card--link\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/list/oldest-flags-in-the-world/\"> \n       <p class=\"card__title\">Oldest flags</p> \n       <p class=\"card__meta\">The oldest national flag designs still flying today, ordered by the year each was adopted.</p> \n      </a> <a class=\"card card--outlined card--link\" href=\"https://flagquizzes.com/list/flags-with-animals/\"> \n       <p class=\"card__title\">Flags with animals</p> \n       <p class=\"card__meta\">Every national flag featuring an animal — eagles, lions, birds of paradise and one dragon. With what each animal represents.</p> \n      </a>\n     </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section prose\">\n     <h2>How this site works</h2>\n     <p>Every quiz here runs on the same set of 197 countries and territories, with flags, capitals, land area, population and borders drawn from one dataset. Pick a continent or a smaller region and the questions narrow to it.</p>\n     <p>Wrong answers are chosen deliberately rather than at random. A question about Chad will offer Romania; a question about Monaco will offer Indonesia. Guessing by elimination does not work, which is the point — those are exactly the pairs people get wrong in real life.</p>\n     <p>When a round ends you get a list of what you missed, and each entry links to a page about that flag: which colours it uses, when it was adopted, its proportions, and the flags it is most often confused with.</p>\n     <p>There is no account and no score history on a server. Your per-item accuracy is kept in your own browser so flashcard mode can lead with the items you are weakest on, and nothing is sent anywhere.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-heading\">\n     <h2 id=\"faq-heading\">Frequently asked questions</h2>\n     <div class=\"stack\">\n      <details class=\"card card--outlined\">\n       <summary><strong>Which quiz should I start with?</strong></summary>\n       <p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"margin-block-start:.75rem\">Start with the world flags quiz above. It draws from all 197 countries and shows you immediately which regions you are weakest in.</p>\n      </details>\n      <details class=\"card card--outlined\">\n       <summary><strong>Do the quizzes work on a phone?</strong></summary>\n       <p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"margin-block-start:.75rem\">Yes. The map quizzes support pinch-to-zoom and drag, and every other mode is designed for one-handed use.</p>\n      </details>\n      <details class=\"card card--outlined\">\n       <summary><strong>How do I learn the flags I keep getting wrong?</strong></summary>\n       <p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"margin-block-start:.75rem\">Every result screen lists what you missed, and each entry links to a page explaining that flag: its colours, its history, and the flags it is most often confused with.</p>\n      </details>\n     </div>\n    </section>\n   </div>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "这个交互式网站提供了一个全面的测验系统，通过多种游戏模式和难度级别，帮助用户学习和测试所有 197 个国家的旗帜、首都、地图及相关地理知识。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "这个交互式网站提供了一个全面的测验系统，通过多种游戏模式和难度级别，帮助用户学习和测试所有 197 个国家的旗帜、首都、地图及相关地理知识。",
  "summary": "Flags Quiz 网站提供了一个广泛的交互式平台，用于学习和测试世界地理知识。它提供了覆盖 197 个国家和地区的测验，用户可以根据旗帜、首都、地图、形状、货币和语言进行游戏。该网站提供多种游戏模式，包括选择题、判断题、选旗、异类选出、高低比较、缺失字母、输入答案、限时生存和闪卡。用户可以选择不同的难度级别（简单、中等、困难），或一次性挑战所有国家。平台还包含美国州份、河流和海洋的测验。网站强调故意选择错误答案以模拟现实世界中的混淆模式，并为每面旗帜提供详细解释，包括颜色、采用历史、比例和常见混淆点。这些测验设计为可在手机上使用，无需用户账户，进度会在浏览器中本地存储。",
